1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:01,250
That’s right.

2
00:00:01,250 --> 00:00:03,250
I am the Godfather.

3
00:00:03,416 --> 00:00:05,125
Hahaha!

4
00:00:05,125 --> 00:00:08,750
If you’re the Godfather,
then I’m his goddamn brother!

5
00:00:08,875 --> 00:00:10,875
I'm feeling generous.

6
00:00:11,250 --> 00:00:12,500
Get out now, or-

7
00:00:12,500 --> 00:00:13,875
You’re dead.

8
00:00:17,000 --> 00:00:17,750
Kill him!

9
00:00:24,125 --> 00:00:24,875
You!

10
00:00:24,916 --> 00:00:28,375
You! you dared attack
someone from the Sovereign Sanctum?!

11
00:00:28,666 --> 00:00:29,541
Just wait!

12
00:00:29,541 --> 00:00:31,875
I'll have the Holy
Knight come and end you!

13
00:00:33,291 --> 00:00:34,500
Good.

14
00:00:34,625 --> 00:00:35,875
I’ll wait.

15
00:00:41,250 --> 00:00:43,791
My lord, you're finally here!

16
00:00:44,041 --> 00:00:47,000
Who dares cause
trouble in my territory?

17
00:00:47,000 --> 00:00:48,125
That would be me.

18
00:00:50,666 --> 00:00:52,458
G-Godfather!

19
00:00:52,750 --> 00:00:54,000
 You've done well.

20
00:00:54,000 --> 00:00:55,416
He's the only
one in all of

21
00:00:55,416 --> 00:00:57,666
Golantis who dared
say he'd kill me.

22
00:01:01,875 --> 00:01:04,625
How dare you show
disrespect to the Godfather!

23
00:01:04,625 --> 00:01:05,791
Die!

24
00:01:08,000 --> 00:01:10,125
I failed to keep
order in my territory.

25
00:01:10,125 --> 00:01:12,250
I await your punishment, Godfather.

26
00:01:12,250 --> 00:01:15,000
Return every coin
of money they took.

27
00:01:15,000 --> 00:01:16,416
Then report to the Holy Court

28
00:01:16,416 --> 00:01:18,375
for your own punishment.

29
00:01:18,375 --> 00:01:19,500
Yes, my lord!

30
00:01:20,291 --> 00:01:22,250
Well, our little trip got ruined.

31
00:01:22,250 --> 00:01:23,500
Let’s go home.

32
00:01:24,041 --> 00:01:26,375
Go home to 
do what, my lord?

33
00:01:26,916 --> 00:01:28,250
What do you think?

34
00:01:29,250 --> 00:01:29,791
Fine.

35
00:01:29,791 --> 00:01:31,041
Let's go home...

36
00:01:31,041 --> 00:01:33,791
and make you a little Godfather.
